SUMMARY:Art Reception at Reichwage Winery: Paintings and Artisan Wood Creations
DESCRIPTION:Featuring Jann Aanestad & Ken Hower \nDate: Sunday\, November 22\, 2026 | 1–4 PM\nLocation: Reichwage Winery\, 1689 Pleasant Hill Rd\, Sebastopol \nJoin us for an afternoon celebrating art\, nature\, and creativity with local artists Jann Aanestad and Ken Hower. Meet the artists\, explore their work\, and enjoy light bites in the lovely setting of Reichwage Winery. Wine by the glass and tastings will also be available for purchase.\nResilience | Jann Aanestad \nJann’s colorful paintings capture the beauty of nature\, the stories held in familiar places\, and quiet moments in everyday life. Inspired by her own remarkable journey of recovery and renewal\, her work celebrates resilience\, the transformative power of light\, and the beauty that surrounds us. \nShaped by Nature | Ken Hower \nKen creates beautiful artisan woodwork\, transforming walnut\, oak\, manzanita\, and olive into one-of-a-kind bowls\, platters\, boards\, and decorative art. His pieces celebrate the natural grain\, rich textures\, and flowing organic shapes of wood\, highlighting the unique character and beauty of each piece. \nCome for the art\, stay for the atmosphere\, and discover the hidden gem that is Reichwage Winery.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/art-reception-at-reichwage-winery-paintings-and-artisan-wood-creations/
LOCATION:ReichwageWinery\, 1689 Pleasant Hill Rd\,\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Visual Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Handcrafted-Wood-and-Vineyard-Gallery-Showcase.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Heather Howland":MAILTO:hhowland@yahoo.com
END:VEVENT
