SUMMARY:North Bay Letterpress Arts Holiday Open House
DESCRIPTION:oin us at our Sebastopol printery on Sunday\, December 6 from 11a-4p for our annual Holiday Open House✨ \nWhat to expect:\n〰️ delicious snax and Pax wines\n〰️ printshop tours and demos\n〰️ auction items & giveaways\n〰️ mingle music + impromptu poetry\n〰️ great company & conversation\nand more . . . \nSee you there! \n925-D Highway 116 South\n(behind BeeKind Honey)\nSebastopol\, CA 95472
